Name:P20 - fetchland cracked at 6 life into exactly lethal (round 1034, from round 1029's study F10, Hard H4 T14)
Description:The AI is at 6 life with six lands and nothing in hand to cast; the opponent has Gurmag Angler (5/5) untapped. Cracking Bloodstained Mire (pay 1) for a land puts the AI at 5, exactly the Angler's damage. ChangeZoneAi only checks "life after paying >= 4". Rule fetch-life-guard keeps the land when life after paying is at most the opponent's on-board damage and no spell in hand needs the mana. Expect: the AI keeps 6 life. (The real game's AI kept a blocker home; this puzzle has none, so the life point decides.)
